- GraphRAG: Improving global search via dynamic community selection（MS 官方）— https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/graphrag-improving-global-search-via-dynamic-community-selection/
- GraphRAG: Unlocking LLM discovery on narrative private data（MS 官方，**经核实无任何成本/美元数字**）— https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/blog/graphrag-unlocking-llm-discovery-on-narrative-private-data/
